# TUNE: the MUSIC block (M41). It plays AGANAMEM.MUS (on the program's
# disc) behind it, with MUSIC (on A: or B:): with a RAM expansion there
# is room for both. make test-music-block runs it, with 576K.
MODE 1
BG 0

START STAGE
STYLE 1
TEXT "MUSIC BEHIND" 8 20
STYLE 0
MUSIC "AGANAMEM"
TEXT "F6: PROGRAMS" 8 40
